   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0405_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>MKḆLWNty ʾMYṭl Y hwslwḇʾn
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>yʾmkˈ Y hwslwḇʾn nwk-lwcˈ Y
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>ŠNṬ $X-IIII-III lʾd MN dynʾp̄ẕwṭˈ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>ʾN pṭmwzn Y pyš MKḆLWNty
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>W pṭglʾḇ pṭ-š ẔK-m-c
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>nʾcwk pdy-II W šlwʾl-II W PWN
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>pylʾhn wndʾṭˈ I pnbk mnˈ I ○
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>W pṭglʾḇ ʾMYṭl Y hwslwḇʾn
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0405_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>padīrēd mādar ī Xusrōyān
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ǰāmag ī Xusrōyān nōg-rōz ī
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>sāl 37 rāy az Dēnabzūd
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>an paymōzan ī pēš padīrēd
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>ud padīrāy pad-iš ān-am-iz
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>nāzuk pay-dō ud šalwār-dō ud pad
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>pīrāhan windād ēw pambag man ēw ○
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>ud padīrāy mādar ī Xusrōyān
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0405_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>The mother of Xusrōyān receives
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>for the clothing of Xusrōyān on New Yearˈs day of
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>the year 37 from Dēnabzūd,
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>she receives the garment in advance,
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>and on presenting the acknowledgement also this for me,
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>viz. a pair of comfortable shoes and a pair of trousers and for
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>one shirt 1 man of cotton.
               <lb n="8-9" xml:id="trans-p1-l8-9"/>And the mother of Xusrōyān sealed the acknowledgement.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>